 bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Amulet\" title=\"Amulet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png/25px-Amulets_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png/38px-Amulets_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png/50px-Amulets_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Amulet\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png/25px-Amulets_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Amulet\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Amulet\">Amulet</a>\n</td>\n<td><dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Booze_Remedy\" title=\"Booze Remedy\">Booze Remedy</a></dt><dd>While wearing this amulet, regain <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">2d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/25px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/38px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/50px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/25px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">hit points</span></a> per turn while <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alcohol_(Condition)\" title=\"Alcohol (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Drunk\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Alcohol_(Condition)\" title=\"Alcohol (Condition)\">Drunk</a>. Additionally, increase the duration of your inebriation by 5 rounds.</dd></dl>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\" style=\"width: 50px; height: 50px; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Drunken_Cloth\" title=\"Drunken Cloth\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fd/Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><br><a href=\"/wiki/Drunken_Cloth\" title=\"Drunken Cloth\"> <span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Drunken Cloth</span> </a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour\" title=\"Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dd/Armour_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dd/Armour_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dd/Armour_Icon.png/50px-Armour_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dd/Armour_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dd/Armour_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour\" title=\"Armour\">Armour</a>&nbsp;(<a href=\"/wiki/Clothing\" title=\"Clothing\">Clothing</a>)\n</td>\n<td><dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Snowy_Liver\" title=\"Snowy Liver\">Snowy Liver</a></dt><dd>While <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Drunk_(Condition)\" title=\"Drunk (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Drunk\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Drunk_(Condition)\" title=\"Drunk (Condition)\">Drunk</a> you have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>, and you gain <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">Temporary Hit Points</a> equal to your <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> Modifier at the start of your turn.</dd></dl>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\" style=\"width: 50px; height: 50px; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Punch-Drunk_Bastard\" title=\"Punch-Drunk Bastard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/5/5e/Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5e/Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><br><a href=\"/wiki/Punch-Drunk_Bastard\" title=\"Punch-Drunk Bastard\"> <span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Punch-Drunk Bastard</span> </a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Main_Hand_Melee\" title=\"Main Hand Melee\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png/25px-Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png/38px-Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png/50px-Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Main Hand Melee\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png/25px-Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2b/Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Main_Hand_Melee\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Main Hand Melee\">Main Hand Melee</a>&nbsp;(<a href=\"/wiki/Greatclubs\" title=\"Greatclubs\">Greatclub</a>)\n</td>\n<td><dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Tippler%27s_Rage\" title=\"Tippler's Rage\">Tippler's Rage</a></dt><dd>While you are <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Drunk_(Condition)\" title=\"Drunk (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Drunk\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Drunk_(Condition)\" title=\"Drunk (Condition)\">Drunk</a>, you have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a>. You also create a blast with each melee hit landed, dealing <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-thunder\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thunder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-thunder\">Thunder</span></a> damage to all creatures and objects in a radius of 3 m (10 ft), excluding yourself.</dd></dl>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wine_Goblet\" title=\"Wine Goblet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Wine_Goblet_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Wine_Goblet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Wine_Goblet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Wine_Goblet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Wine_Goblet_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Wine_Goblet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Wine_Goblet_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Wine_Goblet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/54/Wine_Goblet_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wine_Goblet\" title=\"Wine Goblet\">Wine Goblets</a> can induce the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alcohol_(Condition)\" title=\"Alcohol (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alcohol\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Alcohol_(Condition)\" title=\"Alcohol (Condition)\">Alcohol</a> condition in combat without costing a bonus action</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200053\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.098 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.104 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2626/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26459/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6810/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4335/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 695109/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   89.259      1 -total\n 38.63%   34.482      1 Template:Table_alignment\n 18.39%   16.411      3 Template:Image_rarity_item\n 16.64%   14.854     44 Template:Trim\n 15.88%   14.177